/T (TDS is among the most effective tax policies available because it ensures compliance with income tax laws and is an important tool for maximising revenue while minimising collection costs \(Shome et al. 1996\). Much of the recent success in tax revenue collection can be attributed to TDS. For example, its share in gross direct tax revenue has increased from 32 percent in FY15 to nearly 39 percent in FY22, as per Department of Revenue data.)
/E (TDS is among the most effective tax policies available because it ensures compliance with income tax laws and is an important tool for maximising revenue while minimising collection costs \(Shome et al. 1996\). Much of the recent success in tax revenue collection can be attributed to TDS. For example, its share in gross direct tax revenue has increased from 32 percent in FY15 to nearly 39 percent in FY22, as per Department of Revenue data.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [2]
>>
