580 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1582 0 R
/ActualText (Trading volumes have decreased significantly on Indian VDA exchanges after the introduction of the new tax architecture. Since 1 April 2022, they have fallen by almost two-thirds, a decline which accelerated after a 1 percent TDS was introduced, as almost 92 percent of volumes were lost to foreign exchanges, compared to the period before the tax was announced. Another slump occurred after the FY24 Union Budget as the market was expecting some tax relief, which did not materialise. )
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [46]
>>
endobj
581 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1583 0 R
/ActualText (There is minor correction in the trading volume trends following the blocking of the URLs on foreign VDA exchanges. But almost 88 percent volume remains lost from Indian exchanges, relative to the period before the tax announcement.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [47]
>>
endobj
582 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1584 0 R
/ActualText (Indian VDA exchanges performed almost three times worse than global VDA exchanges after the TDS was introduced. This disadvantage persists even after the blocking of the URLs, albeit to a lesser extent. )
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [48]
>>
endobj
