673 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1661 0 R
/ActualText (The proportion of profitable users on Indian VDA exchanges was 50 percent before the tax announcements of 1 February 2022. The introduction of capital gains tax without the option of loss set-off and TDS has brought the odds of profit down to only two percent. This result is in line with our earlier finding that the current tax regime has more than doubled the risk exposure of users. AUC also fell significantly after the introduction of taxes and bottomed out after the introduction of TDS.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
674 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1662 0 R
/ActualText <>
/Pg 23 0 R
